{"articleNo":"170920","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=170920&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[4.17-4.19] 2017학년도 복수전공 이수신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.04.05","hit":"3696","attachments":[{"name":"전공별 여석.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=170920&attachNo=4854"},{"name":"복수전공 이수 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=170920&attachNo=5450"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2017학년도&nbsp;복수전공 이수신청 안내</span></span></span></strong></span></font></span></span></span></span></span> </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2017학년도</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span> 복수전공 이수신청</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">에 관한 사항을 </span></font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span>아래와 같이 안내하오니 </span></font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">1. </span><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">신청 기간 : <font color=\"#0900ff\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">2017. 4. 17.(월) ~ 4. 19.(수)</font></font></strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 신청 자격 </span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">3학기이상 등록을 필한 재학생[3학기는 2017학년도 1학기 포함]</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 선발 자격 </span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">: 53학점 이상 이수, 평점평균이 3.0이상[학점은 2017학년도 1학기 포함]</span></span></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 신청 서류</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 가. 복수전공 이수 신청서 1부</span></font></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 나. 성적증명서 1부</span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 신청 장소</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p></strong></span></span></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">복수전공 </span><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">해당 </font></span></font><font color=\"#0900ff\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">\"학사행정실\"</strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; 나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">신청원을 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">작성하여 소속 학부장을 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">경유(날인)한 후, 복수전공 학과장에게 제출</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 신청학과 및 허용인원</span></span></span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#666666\">&nbsp; </font>가<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">. 신청학과 : 붙임 [별표] 참조</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 나. 허용인원 : 전공정원(입학정원)의 50% 이내에서 선발</span></span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. 선발 확정 : </span></span></span></strong></font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2017. 7. 24.(월)</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">8. 복수전공 신청자의 과목이수</span></span></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><font color=\"#666666\"> </font><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">가<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">. 기초도구과목 : 복수전공 학과에서 지정한&nbsp;MSC(기초필수)과목 모두 이수</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 전공과목 <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">: 주전공 및 복수전공의 전공필수과목 반드시 모두 이수</span></span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 2005학년도 이전 입학자 : 주전공은 45학점 이상, 복수전공은 39학점 이상을 이수</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 2006학년도 이후 입학자 : 주전공은 교육과정 이수기준표에 따라 이수, 복수전공은 39학점 이상을 이수</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 자연과학계열 및 인문사회계열은 입학년도에 관계없이 주전공 45학점 이상</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;및 복수전공 39학점 이상을 이수</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2011학년도 이후 입학자 중 컴퓨터공학과 복수전공은 43학점 이상, 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과 복수전공은</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 50학점 이상 이수</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;주전공 과목이 복수전공 과목과 동일한(학부 지정) 경우&nbsp;9학점까지 복수전공 학점으로 인정함. </span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다만, 교직과정 이수자는 중복 인정하지 않음</span></font></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>9. 기타사항</strong> : 복수전공은 공학교육인정과정을 적용하지 아니함</span></span></span></font></span></span></span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p></span></span></span></font></span></font><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2017. 4.</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh, 궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교 무 처 장</span></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
